{"id":899,"bangumiId":899,"type":2,"name":"名探偵コナン","name_cn":"名侦探柯南","date":"1996-01-08","year":"1996","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/01/88/899_REwVW.jpg"},"summary":"主角工藤新一原本是一位颇具名声的高中生侦探，在目击黑暗组织的地下交易后，正准备追踪时却被突袭击昏，并被灌下代号为“APTX4869”（アポトキシン4869）的不明药物。后来虽然幸免于死，但身体就此缩小为小学时期的模样。之后他化名为江户川柯南，在邻居阿笠博士的建议下，寄住在女友毛利兰的父亲—侦探毛利小五郎家中，继续秘密从事追查黑暗组织的工作，并私下探寻获得解药的管道，希望能够恢复原来新一的样貌。与此同时，柯南凭着自己的推理天份，配合阿笠博士为他发明的道具，帮助毛利小五郎成为出名的大侦探。故事内容当中穿插许多爱情、友情、犯罪、背叛、复仇等情节。","rating":{"rank":914,"total":11704,"count":{"1":41,"2":14,"3":41,"4":96,"5":473,"6":1572,"7":3841,"8":3286,"9":1161,"10":1179},"score":7.5},"collection":{"on_hold":3793,"dropped":1297,"wish":1257,"collect":12088,"doing":11047},"tags":[{"name":"柯南","count":4928,"total_count":15380},{"name":"-完结摇摇无指日……","count":3900,"total_count":3940},{"name":"推理","count":3717,"total_count":76106},{"name":"名探偵コナン","count":3530,"total_count":17022},{"name":"万年小学生","count":2476,"total_count":2657},{"name":"青山刚昌","count":1609,"total_count":3099},{"name":"悬疑","count":1205,"total_count":117836},{"name":"TV","count":951,"total_count":1458293},{"name":"看到哪了","count":902,"total_count":1054},{"name":"ACG的启蒙作","count":541,"total_count":586},{"name":"漫画改","count":426,"total_count":900029},{"name":"1996","count":426,"total_count":5678},{"name":"坑","count":424,"total_count":2947},{"name":"童年","count":232,"total_count":95449},{"name":"日本","count":184,"total_count":321070},{"name":"名侦探柯南","count":149,"total_count":17473},{"name":"漫改","count":142,"total_count":373085},{"name":"TMS","count":127,"total_count":18852},{"name":"仓木麻衣","count":102,"total_count":233},{"name":"1996年1月","count":64,"total_count":127},{"name":"长篇","count":61,"total_count":2182}